BayesRoute is a universal, zero-runtime-dependency library and CLI for
Thompson-sampling Bayesian routing that picks the right LLM for every query
across quality, cost, and latency, with per-arm conjugate posteriors, bounded
regret, a safe-exploration guard, optional time-decay, and a tamper-evident
SHA-256 hash-chained audit trail.

